{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The third installment of our Endurance series adds a new batch of prototype and GT machinery to our ever-growing roaster \u2013 this time it is Aston Martin making its grand debut in AMS2, with the pack featuring no less than four formidable models from the prestigious British manufacturer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Starting with the latest V12 sensation: the <strong>Aston Martin Valkyrie Hypercar</strong> has been delivering stunning sights and sounds on both sides of the Atlantic this season, although it still gaining speed in the ultra-competitive GTP / LMDh classes it has already won the hearts of racing fans all over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is a splash of British Racing Green to the GT3 &amp; GT4 classes as well with the latest <strong>Aston Martin Vantage GT3 Evo</strong> &amp; <strong>Aston Martin Vantage GT4 Evo</strong> respectively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rolling back the clock a bit to 2020 for the amazing <strong>Aston Martin Vantage GTE</strong>\u00a0joining the GTE class \u2013 still alive and awesome in AMS2!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is not all about the Astons in however as the light &amp; nimble <strong>Alpine A110 GT4 Evo</strong> is a fresh pretty new face joining the GT4 class as its 9th contender.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finally, the Ligier JS2-R as for now the sole contender in the new Ligier European Series</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cars included in this pack:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aston Martin Valkyrie Hypercar</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aston Martin Vantage GT3 Evo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aston Martin Vantage GTE</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aston Martin Vantage GT4 Evo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alpine A110 GT4 Evo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ligier JS2-R</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3532160?t=1754068004","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532160/17c737484b4a4fb2377c552ade20f92da58c354f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754068004","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532160/d5483b5ea05122ba1a3b5725688b54d17c0f289b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754068004","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532160/d5483b5ea05122ba1a3b5725688b54d17c0f289b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754068004","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The third installment of our Endurance series adds a new batch of prototype and GT machinery to our ever-growing roaster \u2013 this time it is Aston Martin making its grand debut in AMS2, with the pack featuring no less than four formidable models from the prestigious British manufacturer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Starting with the latest V12 sensation: the <strong>Aston Martin Valkyrie Hypercar</strong> has been delivering stunning sights and sounds on both sides of the Atlantic this season, although it still gaining speed in the ultra-competitive GTP / LMDh classes it has already won the hearts of racing fans all over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is a splash of British Racing Green to the GT3 &amp; GT4 classes as well with the latest <strong>Aston Martin Va